# Line endings are decided here rather than by each contributor's core.autocrlf.
# Without it, a Windows checkout rewrote every text file on the way in and Git
# reported the whole tree as modified — a diff nobody could read and a review
# nobody could do. text=auto keeps LF in the repository and lets each platform
# have what it wants in the working copy.
* text=auto

# Vendored TeX files are redistributed verbatim under their own licences, so
# they must not pick up CRLF from a Windows checkout — what we ship should be
# byte-for-byte what CTAN publishes.
assets/fallback-styles/* -text
